    "research-index": "<div class=\"sc-repo-grid\"><div class=\"sc-repo-list\"><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Connecting African Schools: Procurement, Power and Service Accountability for Digital Education</h2><p>UNICEF’s September 2026 invitation to 96 prequalified companies creates a rare chance to procure connectivity services for schools and health facilities across all 54 African countries. The scale is arresting: a potential universe of more than 860,000 schools and 260,000 health facilities. The harder question is institutional. Can a contract for internet access become a durable education service—powered, maintained, used by teachers, safe for children and accountable to the public?</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-4-quality-education\" title=\"SDG 4: Quality Education\" aria-label=\"SDG 4: Quality Education\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#C5192D;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">4</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-10-reduced-inequalities\" title=\"SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities\" aria-label=\"SDG 10: Reduced Inequalities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#DD1367;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">10</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/connecting-african-schools-procurement-power-service-accountability\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/missing-span-africa-power-interconnectors-electricity-markets\" aria-label=\"Africa's Power Interconnectors: Market Readiness, Payment Security and Local Delivery\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6aabb6736fbd81aaa995ace0_ChatGPT%20Image%20Sep%2017%2C%202026%2C%2010_44_12%20AM.png\" alt=\"A West African tailor works beside a grid technician while operators manage a substation connected to towns by transmission lines.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Africa's Power Interconnectors: Market Readiness, Payment Security and Local Delivery</h2><p>Africa is joining national grids into regional power systems. The next test is whether electricity can move through them reliably, be paid for, and reach the people and firms whose demand justified the investment. StoneComms examines the missing span between an interconnector's completion and a functioning market.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/missing-span-africa-power-interconnectors-electricity-markets\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/blue-flame-chokepoint-africa-clean-cooking-resilience\" aria-label=\"Clean Cooking in Africa: LPG Dependence, Fuel Security and Household Resilience\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a9464cc4fd7d63de103b9bf_096e0b33-7bd9-49d9-a20f-a958a89bbed3.png\" alt=\"African clean-cooking systems linking households to fuel, power, distribution and local manufacturing.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Clean Cooking in Africa: LPG Dependence, Fuel Security and Household Resilience</h2><p>Africa’s clean-cooking push is finally attracting serious money and delivering record gains. It is also concentrating risk. Liquefied petroleum gas now provides more than 70 per cent of the continent’s clean-cooking access, captured nearly half of recent summit disbursements, and remains exposed to imported-fuel prices and maritime chokepoints. The answer is not to retreat from LPG. It is to judge every clean-cooking pathway by whether households can keep using it when prices, suppliers or projects fail.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-3-good-health-and-well-being\" title=\"SDG 3: Good Health and Well-being\" aria-label=\"SDG 3: Good Health and Well-being\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#4C9F38;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">3</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-5-gender-equality\" title=\"SDG 5: Gender Equality\" aria-label=\"SDG 5: Gender Equality\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FF3A21;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">5</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/blue-flame-chokepoint-africa-clean-cooking-resilience\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/kilowatt-after-connection-mission-300-productive-use\" aria-label=\"Productive-Use Electrification in Africa: From Connection to Economic Activity under Mission 300\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a948e30afd05bc4618539d0_ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2030%2C%202026%2C%2009_10_03%20PM.png\" alt=\"Productive electricity demand linking farms, businesses and public services to distributed energy in Africa.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Productive-Use Electrification in Africa: From Connection to Economic Activity under Mission 300</h2><p>Mission 300 is accelerating electricity connections across Africa. The next challenge is making those connections economically durable. StoneComms finds that farms, small businesses, clinics, schools, cold chains and mobility can do more than benefit from electricity: they can become the anchor loads that improve the economics of distributed power itself.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/kilowatt-after-connection-mission-300-productive-use\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/open-before-it-locks-kenya-battery-swapping-interoperability\" aria-label=\"Kenya's Battery-Swapping Market: Interoperability, Regulation and Investment Implications\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a944dc74ed50a4d3e8b0f79_African%20E-Mobility%20Battery%20Swap%20Station(3).png\" alt=\"African electric-mobility battery swap station serving motorcycles.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Kenya's Battery-Swapping Market: Interoperability, Regulation and Investment Implications</h2><p>Kenya has entered a rare policy window: electric mobility is scaling quickly, battery swapping is becoming infrastructure rather than a product feature, and the legal framework is still being written. The strategic question is not whether one battery should win. It is which interfaces must be shared before proprietary networks become expensive to unwind.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-11-sustainable-cities-and-communities\" title=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" aria-label=\"SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD9D24;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">11</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-13-climate-action\" title=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" aria-label=\"SDG 13: Climate Action\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#3F7E44;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">13</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/open-before-it-locks-kenya-battery-swapping-interoperability\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">AI Compute and African Mini-Grids: Testing Flexible Digital Demand as an Anchor for Electricity Access</h2><p>The Emergent Grid demonstration announced on 24 September 2026 asks an unusual infrastructure question. Could small, flexible computing loads buy electricity that African mini-grids are not yet selling, giving the power system steadier revenue while local demand grows? Initial sites in Kenya, the Democratic Republic of Congo and Sierra Leone are projected to serve or strengthen service for approximately 85,000 people. The proposition is promising precisely because it is not yet proven. Its value will depend on whether compute is genuinely interruptible, whether savings reach communities, whether digital revenue is additional, and whether the equipment leaves behind stronger local infrastructure rather than a remote enclave.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-7-affordable-and-clean-energy\" title=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" aria-label=\"SDG 7: Affordable and Clean Energy\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FCC30B;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">7</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/ai-compute-african-mini-grids-flexible-demand-electricity-access\">Read research →</a></div></div></div></div>"
